{"seo": {"title": "RCS prices in Sweden: pay per message", "description": "Prices for RCS in Sweden: Basic from 0,316 SEK, Single from 0,462 SEK and Conversation from 0,641 SEK per message. No monthly fees or lock-in periods."}, "heading": "RCS prices for Sweden", "intro": "Here is the list price per message for each type and operator. You only pay for what you send, and there is no monthly fee or lock-in period.", "plans": [{"name": "RCS Basic", "slug": "basic", "price": "0,316 SEK", "badge": "", "short": "Choose Basic when you only send text, up to 160 characters. It also comes from a verified sender with your name and logo. For example order confirmations, delivery updates and one-time codes.", "copy": "The simplest way to get started with RCS and a natural next step from traditional SMS. A text message of up to 160 characters is sent from a verified sender. The recipient sees your company name, your logo and a verification mark right in the messaging app. This builds trust and makes it easier to tell your messages apart from fraud attempts. Basic suits short, clear messages such as order confirmations, delivery notifications, booking reminders and one-time codes, where the message is what matters and you want to keep costs low.", "contents": "Text up to 160 characters from a verified sender", "operatorPrices": [{"operator": "Telia", "price": "0,346 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tele2", "price": "0,326 SEK"}, {"operator": "Telenor", "price": "0,363 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tre", "price": "0,316 SEK"}, {"operator": "Other operators", "price": "0,346 SEK"}]}, {"name": "RCS Single", "slug": "single", "price": "0,462 SEK", "badge": "Most popular", "short": "Choose Single when the message has an image, video, buttons or more than 160 characters. For example campaigns, newsletters and offers.", "copy": "Use the full range of what RCS can offer in a single send. A message can contain images, video, GIF animations, rich cards with a title and description, carousels where the recipient browses between several products, and clickable buttons and suggestions that lead to your website, a phone call, a map or a calendar event. Plain text messages longer than 160 characters also count here. Single suits campaigns, newsletters, product launches and offers where you want to catch attention visually and make it easy for the customer to act right in the message.", "contents": "Image, video, carousel and buttons", "operatorPrices": [{"operator": "Telia", "price": "0,483 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tele2", "price": "0,462 SEK"}, {"operator": "Telenor", "price": "0,557 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tre", "price": "0,481 SEK"}, {"operator": "Other operators", "price": "0,483 SEK"}]}, {"name": "RCS Conversation", "slug": "conversation", "price": "0,641 SEK", "badge": "", "short": "Choose Conversation when the customer replies and you write back and forth, usually within 24 hours. For example customer service and rebooking.", "copy": "Built for dialogue rather than one-way communication. When the recipient replies, a conversation opens where you can send messages back and forth within a limited time window, usually 24 hours. During the conversation you can use all the rich features, such as images, buttons and quick replies, which makes it easy to guide the customer step by step. It suits customer service, rebooking, fault reports, order follow-up and automated chatbot flows, where the customer gets help right in their messaging app instead of having to call or log in somewhere.", "contents": "Two-way dialogue for 24 hours", "operatorPrices": [{"operator": "Telia", "price": "0,694 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tele2", "price": "0,662 SEK"}, {"operator": "Telenor", "price": "0,988 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tre", "price": "0,641 SEK"}, {"operator": "Other operators", "price": "0,694 SEK"}]}], "operators": ["Telia", "Tele2", "Telenor", "Tre", "Other operators"], "countries": [{"code": "SE", "name": "Sweden", "available": true}, {"code": "NO", "name": "Norway", "available": false}, {"code": "DK", "name": "Denmark", "available": false}, {"code": "FI", "name": "Finland", "available": false}], "currencies": [{"code": "SEK", "name": "Swedish krona", "available": true}, {"code": "EUR", "name": "Euro", "available": false}, {"code": "NOK", "name": "Norwegian krone", "available": false}, {"code": "DKK", "name": "Danish krone", "available": false}], "selectorNote": "Prices are stated in SEK per sent message. We sell in Sweden today, and more countries and currencies will come later.", "vatNote": "All prices are stated in SEK and exclude VAT.", "includedHeading": "Always included", "included": ["Verified sender with logo", "Web interface and API", "Delivery reports and statistics", "No setup or monthly fees", "No lock-in period", "Swedish support"], "faqHeading": "Frequently asked questions about pricing", "faq": [{"question": "What do I pay for?", "answer": "You pay for the messages you send. The price depends on the message type and on which operator the recipient has."}, {"question": "Are there any fixed fees?", "answer": "No. There are no monthly fees, setup fees or lock-in periods."}, {"question": "Do the prices include VAT?", "answer": "All prices are stated excluding VAT."}, {"question": "How is a longer text message counted?", "answer": "Text over 160 characters counts as RCS Single."}, {"question": "What does it cost when the customer writes first?", "answer": "The same price as when you start the conversation. RCS Conversation has the same list price regardless of who writes first."}], "volumeText": "Do you send large volumes?", "sms": {"name": "SMS", "contents": "Text up to 160 characters, for example as a fallback", "operatorPrices": [{"operator": "Telia", "price": "0,346 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tele2", "price": "0,336 SEK"}, {"operator": "Telenor", "price": "0,395 SEK"}, {"operator": "Tre", "price": "0,317 SEK"}, {"operator": "Other operators", "price": "0,385 SEK"}]}, "networksHeading": "All networks and prices", "networksNote": "List price per message 